    "Dual-pane SFTP file browser with multi-select, Select-All, and Ctrl+A",
    "Overwrite confirmation with apply-to-all for bulk transfers",
    "Live edit: double-click remote file, auto-upload on save",
    "Local, remote, and dynamic port forwarding",
